<title>USA: ACC sees faster growth next few quarters.</title>
<headline>ACC sees faster growth next few quarters.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACC Corp said on Wednesday that it expects revenue growth to accelerate over the next several quarters.</p>
<p>ACC reported second-quarter earnings per share of $0.25, compared with $0.05 for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>The telecommunications holding company said in a news release that revenue growth should accelerate with the expanded rollout of local services in existing markets, a strategy for entering new markets in Europe and select acquisitions.</p>
